Language English


/* This puzzle is for the Puzzle Box. 

	There are three seperate but identical puzzles. We randomly select the one
	they will try this time. Eventually they will solve one of the three.
*/


Book ShimmeringPuzzleBox Ordered No Keep


Repeat Random

Page PuzzleBox1 Random

	Prolog """
		The puzzle on top of the box shimmers and shifts every few seconds.
		
		Roll four dice and count successes. You may take that many puzzle
		actions this turn. You may always take at least one.
	"""
	
	Puzzle PuzzleBox1

	Mark Unread
End Page PuzzleBox

Page PuzzleBox2 Random

	Prolog """
		The puzzle on top of the box shimmers and shifts every few seconds.
		
		Roll four dice and count successes. You may take that many puzzle
		actions this turn. You may always take at least one.
	"""
	
	Puzzle PuzzleBox2

	Mark Unread
End Page PuzzleBox

Page PuzzleBox3 Random

	Prolog """
		The puzzle on top of the box shimmers and shifts every few seconds.
		
		Roll four dice and count successes. You may take that many puzzle
		actions this turn. You may always take at least one.
	"""
	
	Puzzle PuzzleBox3

	Mark Unread
End Page PuzzleBox




End Book ShimmeringPuzzleBox